  "description": "Evergreen Meadow is a cosy walking simulator set in wide, green meadows filled with gentle hills, quiet paths, and peaceful locations waiting to be discovered. There are no objectives, no combat, and no pressure!\n\nWander through rolling fields, small groves of trees, and tranquil clearings as soft ambient sounds surround you. Every location is designed to feel warm, safe, and unhurried, inviting you to slow down and enjoy the moment!\n\nFeatures:\n>Cosy Exploration – Walk freely through lush green meadows and scenic locations\n>Relaxing Atmosphere – Calm lighting, soft colours, and gentle environmental sounds\n>Casual Walking Simulator – No combat, no fail states, no stress\n>Soothing Soundscape – Ambient music and natural meadow sounds\n>Mindful Experience – Perfect for relaxation, stress relief, or quiet reflection",
